                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts2">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Sito' tr'eyh itltsenh. My Father made a canoe. Told by Ellen Savage at her home in Anchorage, AK, October 2002. Because she had recorded so much that day, Ellen had become hoarse by the time she told this history.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
